# Agent Sam project rules

These instructions are committed with agentsam-sdk and apply when Agent Sam works in this repository.

- Keep the SDK portable; platform-specific infrastructure belongs behind adapters.
- Prefer structural retrieval before semantic retrieval when exact code evidence can answer the question.
- Treat indexes as retrieval substrates, never as prompt dumps.
- Keep context bounded and attach receipts to selected evidence.
- Keep runtime/account state out of `.agentsam/config.json`.
- Preserve real local process/filesystem behavior for CLI workflows.
- Run focused tests first, then release verification for contract changes.
